# Exp 8 induct-quest-no-human — author notes (c2)

Name: `induct-quest-no-human` is the owner-given name
(2026-11-15 rename); it reuses the repo words `induct`
and `quest`, no coinage. The c1 name `induct-solo` and
the word solo for this mode are removed, not synonymed.

Shape (design question, settled): shipped as a skill
mode of `induct`, not its own FSM. The rails (preflight,
parking, budget, dawn report) state as conductor rules
over the existing exp FSM without special cases, so no
queue-level machine is written; queue words name report
outcomes, never new edges. Stated in the skill's Shape
section.

Lessons:
- A rename is not done when the source moves: the
  installer appends renders and Pi exclusions but never
  prunes, so stale `induct-solo` renders in `.pi`,
  `.agents`, `.claude` and the `.pi/settings.json` line
  had to be removed by hand after `bp3 skills install`.
- Grep-asserted phrases must sit on one line (c1 lesson,
  kept): every rails phrase the test greps for is a
  single line in the new skill.

Work:
- `skills/induct-quest-no-human/SKILL.md`: renamed alias
  — pointer to induct plus no-human rails covering every
  Acceptance row (never attests / `BP3_DECIDER` unset /
  never `resume`/`delete` / never pages; blocked or cap
  hit parks with inbox reason and the queue moves on;
  preflight names missing Acceptance rows, open design
  question, red `make check`; stated Run budget stops
  the queue and the dawn report says so; never promotes,
  `quest_fin` stays owner gate; dawn report per quest
  with `exp_fin`, parked inbox, `usage_recorded` totals,
  `bp3 worktree list` sweep; desks only) plus the Shape
  section above.
- `skills/induct/SKILL.md`: Solo variant section renamed
  No-human variant, pointing at the new skill.
- `skills/induct-solo/` and its installed copies in
  `.pi`, `.agents`, `.claude` removed; `.pi/settings.json`
  exclusion renamed.
- Installed copies: `.pi`, `.agents`, `.claude` renders
  of both skills via `bp3 skills install --harness=all`.
- `test/skills.sh`: Pi settings list and alias/rails
  assertions renamed; shape assertion added (77 total).

Verification (observed, c2):
- `./test/skills.sh`: skills tests ok (77 assertions).
- `make check`: exit 0 — shellcheck, check-skills 36
  files, skills/q/worktree/tape/hooks/induct tests ok.
- Rename grep over `skills/`, `test/`, installed skill
  dirs, `.pi/settings.json`, `src/`, `bin/`, `scripts/`:
  no `solo` remains.
- Dawn evidence re-read live in c2 (no new dispatch):
  `bp3 q r 2026-11-15-toy-nohuman-clean` rollup landed,
  exp-1-hello `exp_fin`; `bp3 q r 2026-11-15-toy-solo-park`
  blocked, inbox "seeded park: owner must name the file;
  no autonomous choice"; `bp3 worktree list` empty.
  The live drive itself was c1's (see
  `runs/nohuman-drive-20261115/DAWN-REPORT.md`); c2
  dispatched no fresh build cycle and claims none.
